WEBVTT

00:01.068 --> 00:04.279
Helck saved Alicia just moments
before her execution.

00:04.947 --> 00:06.490
However, right in front of him,

00:06.907 --> 00:09.785
people started awakening as heroes.

00:10.410 --> 00:12.830
And finally, Alicia, as well.

01:44.021 --> 01:49.009
(Heavenly King Vermilio)

01:53.680 --> 01:55.824
Let's destroy humans!

01:56.141 --> 01:59.895
Keep smiling... keep smiling, always.

02:02.356 --> 02:03.065
See?

02:03.732 --> 02:05.442
He was lying.

02:06.193 --> 02:08.362
That smile was just him faking it.

02:10.072 --> 02:12.174
You must think I'm selfish.

02:12.741 --> 02:13.992
If I really care about her,

02:14.284 --> 02:17.137
I should have killed her before
she had to experience pain.

02:18.288 --> 02:19.831
I didn't want to give up.

02:20.582 --> 02:23.877
She was my precious comrade, my friend.

02:24.461 --> 02:25.837
I didn't want to lose her.

02:29.258 --> 02:31.093
I couldn't do anything.

02:32.469 --> 02:34.696
That girl wished for death.

02:35.013 --> 02:36.723
Why didn't you kill her?!

02:37.182 --> 02:38.241
What a fool.

02:40.394 --> 02:42.371
The more you struggle,

02:42.562 --> 02:44.840
the more will you be in despair!

02:45.941 --> 02:47.276
Shut up!

02:47.501 --> 02:49.653
I'll change things! I'll change it all!

02:49.945 --> 02:51.214
This kind of ending...

02:51.405 --> 02:53.073
She's still fighting against it.

02:53.240 --> 02:56.660
I can still make it!
I just need to stop this snow now!

02:57.077 --> 02:58.537
Stop struggling, Helck.

03:00.539 --> 03:01.973
It's all over.

03:02.332 --> 03:04.134
Zell... you...

03:04.668 --> 03:05.961
That form of yours...

03:06.878 --> 03:09.798
Even if it's a forced awakening,
if the compatibility is high,

03:10.173 --> 03:13.593
seems like it's possible to
retain your sense of self and body.

03:15.220 --> 03:20.033
Thanks to that, I had to witness
the worst sight I've ever seen.

03:20.559 --> 03:22.144
I couldn't do anything.

03:22.561 --> 03:25.997
I couldn't even protect
my comrades who needed help.

03:26.982 --> 03:30.110
Zell... you... are you okay?

03:30.402 --> 03:31.486
You resisted it, right?

03:31.987 --> 03:33.088
Resisted?

03:36.074 --> 03:37.993
Why should I resist it?

03:39.411 --> 03:42.093
Look, Helck.
My body is light!

03:42.094 --> 03:45.083
It's like I've been fighting
with shackles all this time!

03:45.500 --> 03:47.878
Awakening is such a wonderful thing!

03:48.045 --> 03:49.421
The power of the hero...

03:49.713 --> 03:52.632
This amazing power that
opens up infinite possibilities...

03:53.133 --> 03:55.969
I was able to have it,
this power of the hero.

03:56.470 --> 03:58.029
I am part of the chosen!

04:02.934 --> 04:04.436
He lost himself to power.

04:05.020 --> 04:06.487
He didn't keep his sense of self,

04:06.793 --> 04:08.857
but he was a different being
with the same memories.

04:09.483 --> 04:12.778
The snow kept falling,
but the awakening process was already done.

04:13.445 --> 04:15.989
There were no normal humans left anywhere.

04:16.656 --> 04:18.291
But then, if you defeat the king,

04:19.291 --> 04:21.709
they can at least be freed
from his control, right?

04:21.995 --> 04:24.915
Even if a thousand heroes
stand in your way,

04:25.248 --> 04:28.168
I know you must be able
to take down the king easily!

04:29.211 --> 04:31.211
Of course, I wanted to take down the king.

04:31.755 --> 04:34.591
However, taking down the king
won't solve anything.

04:36.093 --> 04:38.929
Normally, those who awaken
will start going berserk.

04:39.638 --> 04:42.099
The thing that keeps that from happening
is the king's ability,

04:42.349 --> 04:43.850
the Power of Rule.

04:45.477 --> 04:49.648
Which means, if we take down the king,
those humans will

04:49.940 --> 04:52.025
only destroy and kill
until their very end.

04:52.776 --> 04:55.278
They will end up being
something similar to monsters.

04:56.238 --> 04:57.197
Don't lie to me!

04:57.781 --> 04:59.116
I won't get fooled!

04:59.408 --> 05:03.328
I will kill the king! I'll kill him
and turn this situation around!

05:05.872 --> 05:08.058
You really don't know when to give up.

05:08.542 --> 05:11.128
What Rafaed said was all correct.

05:11.378 --> 05:15.023
Even if you kill the king,
the future you wish for will not happen.

05:15.757 --> 05:16.716
Mikaros...

05:17.050 --> 05:18.260
So you're alive!

05:20.262 --> 05:21.388
If it weren't for you...

05:23.140 --> 05:25.033
Yes... that power!

05:25.033 --> 05:26.535
That was dangerous.

05:26.768 --> 05:30.455
I've seen many talented fighters
throughout my life,

05:30.455 --> 05:33.917
but no one has had
a strength as great as yours.

05:34.401 --> 05:36.002
If it weren't for you...

05:36.486 --> 05:39.072
If it weren't for you,

05:39.714 --> 05:41.741
things wouldn't have ended up like this!

05:42.117 --> 05:44.117
Cless also didn't have to die!

05:45.620 --> 05:49.541
If it weren't for me, Cless would've
died on the day the snow fell.

05:49.541 --> 05:51.624
Shut up!

05:53.170 --> 05:56.565
Also, you're forgetting
one important thing.

05:56.840 --> 06:00.552
I told you that Cless's existence
is vital to the plan.

06:01.511 --> 06:02.846
Look below you.

06:07.267 --> 06:09.119
Do you know who that is?

06:11.605 --> 06:12.522
Cless...

06:13.607 --> 06:18.461
Because the Hero Killer broke,
the magic power in it must've been halved.

06:18.695 --> 06:22.908
He looks a little unsightly,
but I was able to prevent his death.

06:23.533 --> 06:25.994
Well, it didn't matter if he died, anyway.

06:26.620 --> 06:28.513
That thing still has
something it has to do.

06:28.830 --> 06:32.626
Even if it's only his head remaining,
I can't let it just rest.

06:32.626 --> 06:33.543
Mikaros...

06:34.061 --> 06:35.045
You...

06:35.712 --> 06:36.755
You!

06:37.272 --> 06:39.816
How do you feel? Happy?

06:39.816 --> 06:42.485
Sad? It's complicated, right?

06:42.719 --> 06:47.198
The awakening plan was able to
continue because it was alive, after all.

06:51.102 --> 06:53.605
What incredible power!

06:53.813 --> 06:56.916
If that girl with the Hero Killer
hadn't stopped you back then,

06:57.067 --> 07:00.445
maybe things wouldn't
have ended up like this.

07:02.130 --> 07:06.384
However, in exchange, humans would've
come to ruin by your hands.

07:09.663 --> 07:11.598
What is that... just now?

07:12.415 --> 07:13.933
You monster.

07:13.933 --> 07:17.354
Even if it was a little dangerous,
I guess I should've killed you back then.

07:17.629 --> 07:20.482
However, I won't let you get in my way.

07:21.591 --> 07:25.095
The power from that world,
brought here by Cless's power...

07:25.387 --> 07:29.933
This is the path created from that power,
a path to teleport through space!

07:30.517 --> 07:33.895
It's too dangerous for me
to fight you right now.

07:34.688 --> 07:37.040
I'll have to dispose of you as you are.

07:37.315 --> 07:40.001
Now, then, where will it take you?

07:41.653 --> 07:44.030
Helck... you did great.

07:44.364 --> 07:47.008
You fought hard against us by yourself.

07:48.410 --> 07:50.604
However, this is the truth of this world.

07:50.604 --> 07:53.765
No one can turn back
this sequence of events.

07:54.249 --> 07:56.668
The awakened humans can't
go back to how they once were.

07:56.918 --> 07:59.588
The future you wish for will not happen.

07:59.979 --> 08:04.568
You should forget everything and
live out your days somewhere quiet.

08:16.771 --> 08:19.357
I see... and that's how you
ended up in the demon lands.

08:19.858 --> 08:22.694
In the end, I couldn't do anything.

08:23.320 --> 08:24.904
I couldn't save anyone.

08:25.655 --> 08:26.531
Not a single one.

08:27.824 --> 08:28.992
Foolish humans.

08:29.509 --> 08:31.386
New world creatures who shouldn't exist.

08:31.995 --> 08:34.418
Those odd beings, Mikaros and Rafaed.

08:35.582 --> 08:36.850
There's a lot to think about,

08:37.375 --> 08:39.044
but for now, Helck...

08:39.794 --> 08:42.631
How much regret and pain
have you been bearing?

08:43.506 --> 08:45.175
All I can do is sympathize...

08:46.092 --> 08:47.802
But I'm still going to fight.

08:48.470 --> 08:50.972
I have the power to defeat those humans.

08:51.556 --> 08:52.599
And so, I...

08:53.183 --> 08:55.285
Can you really... fight them?

08:56.394 --> 08:57.479
They were your comrades.

08:58.104 --> 08:59.648
That... would be painful.

09:00.023 --> 09:01.066
Sorrowful.

09:01.900 --> 09:02.776
Enough of that.

09:03.109 --> 09:04.527
You don't have to fight.

09:05.236 --> 09:06.071
Ann...

09:06.321 --> 09:08.198
What they want is us.

09:09.157 --> 09:11.034
You should leave the rest to us.

09:11.743 --> 09:12.661
And you don't have to...

09:13.328 --> 09:14.954
When I was transported to demon lands,

09:15.538 --> 09:17.290
and I got lost in the wilderness,

09:17.832 --> 09:19.832
it was Kenros who helped me.

09:21.461 --> 09:23.461
Why is a human at a place like this?

09:23.713 --> 09:25.382
Wait, you're all beaten up!

09:25.757 --> 09:26.733
Come to my place.

09:27.025 --> 09:29.528
It's a little far away,
but you must be hungry, right?

09:29.969 --> 09:31.554
I'll treat you to some tasty stuff!

09:31.888 --> 09:37.035
Kenros invited me, a human, to his town,
without any hesitation at all.

09:38.144 --> 09:41.080
The townsfolk, too...
Even after I said I'm a human,

09:41.231 --> 09:43.566
and I'm the brother of the hero
who took down the Demon Lord,

09:43.942 --> 09:45.568
they all treated me kindly.

09:46.111 --> 09:47.529
It made me happy.

09:48.071 --> 09:52.992
The fact that I was treated kindly,
and that demons are actually nice people.

09:53.952 --> 09:56.496
I don't want to see them get hurt.

09:57.038 --> 09:58.498
Ah... I see.

09:59.040 --> 10:02.210
"I want to save the comrades I
couldn't save from their curse"...

10:02.794 --> 10:05.296
I thought that's what
has been driving Helck.

10:06.047 --> 10:07.424
But that's not all.

10:07.924 --> 10:09.300
Within Helck's heart,

10:09.759 --> 10:11.694
he now has us, other races.

10:12.345 --> 10:13.930
The reason why Helck is fighting

10:14.389 --> 10:16.850
also includes protecting us.

10:17.892 --> 10:18.560
Idiot.

10:19.144 --> 10:21.563
He shouldn't even have the space
to worry about others right now...

10:22.147 --> 10:22.772
Idiot.

10:26.109 --> 10:26.735
Ann.

10:27.277 --> 10:30.463
Currently, humans are a much more dangerous
existence than you think they are.

10:30.655 --> 10:35.368
And it's not only because
the humans have awakened to be heroes.

10:35.785 --> 10:37.454
Most likely, awakened humans,

10:37.871 --> 10:41.666
through some kind of power, now have
the ability to come back to life after they die.

10:42.725 --> 10:43.376
Could it be...

10:44.169 --> 10:46.004
That's the reason why
he stopped Hyura back then?

10:47.338 --> 10:49.357
Defeating the humans as they are now...

10:49.883 --> 10:52.969
Even the people from the Empire
like you wouldn't be able to do it easily.

10:53.762 --> 10:54.429
That's why...

10:55.054 --> 10:56.598
I have to be the one to do it.

10:57.474 --> 10:59.100
Even if it costs me my life,

10:59.517 --> 11:02.687
I have to put an end to them
as a fellow human.

11:03.772 --> 11:05.356
I have the power to do that.

11:05.982 --> 11:08.109
Now's the time for me to use that power.

11:08.735 --> 11:09.277
But...

11:09.819 --> 11:13.198
...my power might be even
more terrifying than humans.

11:13.865 --> 11:16.201
I think you must also
have realized that by now.

11:17.452 --> 11:19.287
When I feel a great wrath,

11:19.662 --> 11:21.662
sometimes I become
unable to control myself.

11:22.457 --> 11:24.667
If I keep letting that wrath take over me,

11:24.959 --> 11:25.960
I will surely...

11:26.461 --> 11:28.461
...end up hurting you all as well.

11:29.088 --> 11:31.674
And that's why you're
handing the Hero Killer to me.

11:32.050 --> 11:32.717
Yeah.

11:33.218 --> 11:35.486
I actually wanted to hand it to Azudra.

11:36.012 --> 11:39.098
I thought becasue he's a Heavenly King,
he should be able to stop me.

11:39.849 --> 11:40.975
However, I couldn't meet him.

11:41.684 --> 11:42.717
Now that I think about it,

11:42.718 --> 11:45.855
I was naive to think that I would be able
to meet someone higher than a Demon Lord.

11:46.356 --> 11:48.233
No, you could've met him.

11:48.691 --> 11:49.859
He was just hospitalized.

11:50.360 --> 11:52.360
If possible,
I didn't want to drag you into this.

11:52.946 --> 11:55.490
But right now,
you're the only one I can rely on.

11:56.199 --> 11:58.326
You're strong. If it's you,

11:58.701 --> 12:01.204
I can guarantee that you can stop me.

12:03.331 --> 12:04.249
Once again,

12:04.833 --> 12:06.334
I want you to listen to my request.

12:07.060 --> 12:08.795
Please take the Hero Killer.

12:09.963 --> 12:11.963
If I happen to start going berserk,

12:12.423 --> 12:14.175
I don't care about my life.

12:14.759 --> 12:16.261
Before I cause great harm,

12:16.678 --> 12:18.346
stop me with your own hands.

12:20.056 --> 12:21.349
Before I give you my reply,

12:22.350 --> 12:24.853
I also have something
I have to confess to you.

12:25.520 --> 12:26.187
Helck.

12:26.938 --> 12:28.565
I'm actually not Ann.

12:30.024 --> 12:32.024
I'm actually one of
the Empire's Four Heavenly Kings,

12:33.027 --> 12:35.363
Heavenly King Red Vermilio.

12:36.673 --> 12:37.949
I'm sorry for keeping quiet about this.

12:39.492 --> 12:42.203
Helck. I understand your determination.

12:42.871 --> 12:44.038
That request of yours...

12:44.497 --> 12:47.584
As a Heavenly King, as your comrade,

12:47.959 --> 12:49.959
I will accept it and bear responsibility.

12:50.503 --> 12:53.339
I promise I will be able
to meet your expectations.

12:54.066 --> 12:54.666
Ann...

12:54.924 --> 12:58.553
In exchange for that,
carve these next words into your heart.

12:59.387 --> 13:01.322
Don't fight with the intent to die!

13:01.723 --> 13:03.723
Fight with the conviction to live on!

13:04.225 --> 13:05.101
You...

13:06.060 --> 13:07.186
...are not alone!

13:10.815 --> 13:12.025
Once everything is over,

13:12.567 --> 13:13.902
you should come to the Empire.

13:14.402 --> 13:15.194
It'll be fine.

13:15.570 --> 13:17.405
I'm sure everyone will welcome you.

13:21.534 --> 13:22.577
Thank you...

13:37.592 --> 13:42.180
I didn't think the skies outside the Empire
would have a monster like that...

13:42.597 --> 13:46.309
It's my first mission, but now
I'm the only one left able to move.

13:46.643 --> 13:49.395
(Tracking Level: 29) (Search Party Rookie, Harpie)
I can't do this. This is too much for me.

13:49.646 --> 13:52.732
I wouldn't be able to find
Lady Vermilio on my own...

13:55.860 --> 13:57.946
Isn't it faster for us to walk?

13:58.154 --> 14:00.073
No, it's better to wait for a train.

14:00.406 --> 14:02.575
As far as I know, it's quite fast.

14:02.992 --> 14:04.953
Really? I'm excited!

14:05.161 --> 14:07.789
I've never heard of
a vehicle called train!

14:07.872 --> 14:08.998
Me too!

14:11.393 --> 14:12.210
It's here.

14:14.587 --> 14:16.064
Tweet!

14:16.064 --> 14:17.048
Wow!

14:17.298 --> 14:18.257
It has arrived.

14:20.635 --> 14:22.762
Sorry. Can you let us on?

14:24.847 --> 14:25.682
Hop on.

14:32.263 --> 14:34.263
(Great Meadow Milk Ice Cream)

14:38.236 --> 14:38.987
Hey, kid.

14:38.987 --> 14:39.971
I'm Piwi!

14:40.279 --> 14:41.839
- Are you lost?
- Nope!

14:42.573 --> 14:43.758
You like trains?

14:43.758 --> 14:44.467
Yeah!

14:48.271 --> 14:50.206
(Great Meadow Pasta Set)

15:33.624 --> 15:34.959
Bye bye!

15:35.293 --> 15:36.185
Then, let's go.

15:36.311 --> 15:36.946
Yeah!

15:41.632 --> 15:42.633
Rock hard skin.

15:42.984 --> 15:44.944
Powerful jaws, sharp fangs.

15:44.944 --> 15:47.655
And that scorching breath
spewed from your mouth...

15:47.930 --> 15:50.992
I'm sure a lot of warriors
have fallen before you.

15:51.684 --> 15:53.369
However, you chose the wrong opponent.

15:54.854 --> 15:55.767
Good job!

15:56.647 --> 15:58.900
It's been a while since
I've seen a monster that violent.

15:59.692 --> 16:02.945
And it's very faint, but I can also
feel that bad air from the demon lands.

16:03.654 --> 16:05.281
Seems like we've gotten quite close.

16:06.282 --> 16:09.594
There's a possibility that more strong
enemies like this will appear from here on.

16:10.036 --> 16:12.789
But let me deal with the easy ones.

16:13.081 --> 16:15.833
You should just focus on protecting Piwi.

16:16.250 --> 16:16.976
Got it!

16:17.251 --> 16:18.127
Now, let's go.

16:18.920 --> 16:21.022
We have to reach the town before sundown.

16:21.022 --> 16:22.507
If not, we can't get dinner!

16:23.591 --> 16:27.220
Oh? I didn't think
there'd be any travelers here.

16:27.553 --> 16:30.098
I'm the chief of the village ahead.

16:30.389 --> 16:35.353
Traveler, if you value your life,
you should move away from this area.

16:35.645 --> 16:38.998
This area will soon be a land of the dead.

16:38.998 --> 16:39.790
What?

16:39.941 --> 16:42.335
The seal was broken.

16:42.485 --> 16:48.825
Long ago, a certain wizard created
the strongest and cruelest creature...

16:48.967 --> 16:51.010
The strongest and cruelest creature?

16:51.010 --> 16:54.038
Rock hard skin that
would deflect any blade.

16:54.580 --> 16:56.999
Powerful jaws that can smash any boulder.

16:57.233 --> 17:01.729
With its powerful wings that can
lift its giant body, it rules the skies.

17:01.921 --> 17:06.164
The scorching gas from its mouth
can burn anything in a second.

17:07.009 --> 17:12.431
Countless potential warriors have
lost their lives to that monster...

17:12.431 --> 17:12.642
Countless potential warriors have
lost their lives to that monster...
The remaining warriors intend
to have one last fight with it today.

17:12.642 --> 17:17.019
The remaining warriors intend
to have one last fight with it today.

17:17.164 --> 17:19.021
Although I'm sure it's impossible...

17:19.164 --> 17:22.875
There's nothing that can
win against that monster.

17:23.164 --> 17:26.904
Now, before that monster finds you,
you should go away.

17:27.113 --> 17:29.615
- Um...
- Don't worry about us.

17:29.907 --> 17:33.995
We've protected this land since
our forefather's time. Dying here is our fate.

17:34.287 --> 17:37.707
No, I think I've already
defeated that monster just now...

17:39.375 --> 17:41.394
You're such a kind girl.

17:41.394 --> 17:43.462
But you don't have to try to comfort me.

17:43.838 --> 17:45.214
No, I'm not trying to comfort you.

17:45.840 --> 17:48.234
It must be that thing
tumbling there, right?

17:48.694 --> 17:50.694
Y-You brats!

17:51.345 --> 17:54.348
Don't play jokes on me
just because I'm old!

17:54.891 --> 17:57.351
Hey, look! The monster is dead!

17:57.619 --> 17:58.744
Isn't it a fake?

17:58.744 --> 18:00.104
No, no doubt about it!

18:00.438 --> 18:01.939
The monster is dead!

18:02.273 --> 18:04.792
Chief! The monster is dead!

18:07.403 --> 18:09.197
Time to party!

18:12.366 --> 18:14.744
Annie, they all seem to be having fun!

18:15.119 --> 18:16.971
We won't be able to sleep until morning.

18:17.205 --> 18:18.639
But isn't it great?

18:18.998 --> 18:22.376
Even if it's a coincidence,
thanks to you, this city is saved!

18:22.960 --> 18:24.337
Yeah. You're right.

18:24.837 --> 18:27.565
They also gave us good food and lodging.

18:27.840 --> 18:30.026
We're the ones who should be thankful.

18:31.552 --> 18:33.070
The night breeze feels nice.

18:38.517 --> 18:41.537
I don't know what
Lady Vermilio looks like!

18:41.771 --> 18:42.955
Process of elimination!

18:43.147 --> 18:46.334
This person is... He-Helck!

18:46.484 --> 18:48.085
Huh?! What's that creature?

18:48.277 --> 18:50.796
I-Is he Lady Ver...

18:51.030 --> 18:54.075
No, Lady Vermilio has red hair! It's her!

18:55.076 --> 18:57.636
A-Are you Lady Vermilio?!

18:57.703 --> 18:59.455
Are you the search party sent by Azudra?

18:59.747 --> 19:01.432
T-That's right!

19:01.432 --> 19:04.085
I-I'm Harpie, from the search party!

19:04.335 --> 19:05.102
Oh!

19:05.102 --> 19:07.271
So Azudra and the others are alright?

19:07.421 --> 19:08.506
Y-Yes!

19:08.649 --> 19:12.969
At least, when we departed,
they seemed to have some room to breathe.

19:13.302 --> 19:14.220
That's a relief.

19:14.553 --> 19:17.490
I was a little worried after
hearing Helck's story...

19:18.015 --> 19:21.269
Well, if Azudra is with them,
they wouldn't get taken down so easily.

19:23.120 --> 19:25.039
I finally found you!

19:25.039 --> 19:26.832
Thank goodness!

19:26.832 --> 19:28.567
Mission complete!

19:28.567 --> 19:30.278
Here, wipe off your tears.

19:30.861 --> 19:31.721
Thank you for your work.

19:31.988 --> 19:35.157
H-Hero Helck! Thank you...

19:36.117 --> 19:37.702
Then, you're all by yourself?

19:37.952 --> 19:38.953
Yes...

19:39.203 --> 19:41.872
We were all attacked by a flying monster,

19:41.872 --> 19:44.709
and I'm the only one left able to move.

19:45.001 --> 19:46.168
You've gone great work.

19:46.794 --> 19:49.046
You didn't return and came
all the way here despite the danger...

19:49.547 --> 19:50.214
I'm grateful.

19:50.214 --> 19:52.675
What?! I-It's nothing to be thankful for!

19:53.175 --> 19:54.385
However, in that case...

19:54.844 --> 19:58.222
Even if she could carry me and Piwi,
she wouldn't be able to carry Helck.

19:59.640 --> 20:01.475
She came all the way here,

20:01.851 --> 20:03.894
but I guess I have to send her back...

20:04.270 --> 20:05.438
No, wait.

20:05.980 --> 20:08.541
Azudra must have seen
this situation coming...

20:08.941 --> 20:10.109
Lady Vermilio,

20:10.109 --> 20:13.671
I-I'm not here just to take you back!

20:13.671 --> 20:15.281
I also have a message for you!

20:15.990 --> 20:17.658
Ah! I knew it!

20:18.659 --> 20:20.052
Dear Vermilikins,

20:20.244 --> 20:23.414
If you are now moving with Helck,

20:23.682 --> 20:27.393
you shouldn't head to the Empire,
but to the southern part of human lands.

20:27.626 --> 20:28.461
Azu.

20:28.961 --> 20:30.271
I see.

20:30.588 --> 20:33.132
Using the missing persons
as a core to his strategy...

20:33.758 --> 20:34.759
That's just like him.

20:35.009 --> 20:36.635
Ann, this is...

20:37.178 --> 20:38.054
Don't worry.

20:38.429 --> 20:40.306
There's no change in our course.

20:40.973 --> 20:41.974
More importantly, Helck.

20:42.475 --> 20:46.937
Seems like you've been included
as part of the Empire's strategy.

20:47.438 --> 20:48.064
Huh?

20:49.565 --> 20:53.986
What?! Is it okay for us to just
take it easy and fight the enemy?

20:54.362 --> 20:56.697
In that case, we wouldn't be able
to defeat the king!

20:56.989 --> 20:58.074
Plan A.

20:58.574 --> 21:00.868
The ones who will
defeat the king are not us.

21:01.369 --> 21:02.912
This is a diversion.

21:03.371 --> 21:05.790
We'll lure the enemy as much as we can.

21:06.123 --> 21:07.333
That is enough.

21:07.958 --> 21:09.377
The ones who will defeat the king...

21:10.419 --> 21:11.962
...are Helck and Vermilikins.

21:12.380 --> 21:13.506
Those two.

22:44.990 --> 22:48.534
(Next Episode) (Mysterious Girl)
Next episode, "Mysterious Girl".
